  "description": "Raised under strict parents who constantly threw harsh words at her, Yeonjin would sometimes visit a piercing shop as a small act of rebellion. The handsome shop owner, who had always given her a curious look, finally asked her on a rainy day when they were alone in the shop.\n\n\"So, do you really want me to pierce you today?\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/wanna_pierce), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/wanna_pierce), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000077998), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14073662), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=260327)",
